    <mxCell id="an_bad_T177" value="&lt;div style='width:414px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#991B1B;'&gt;✕ ASKING &quot;HOW SURE ARE YOU?&quot;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;Model replies &quot;95% confident!&quot; right before inventing a statute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#FECACA;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="140" width="424" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="an_good_T177" value="&lt;div style='width:426px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#065F46;'&gt;✓ ISOTONIC + CONFORMAL SCALING:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;ECE 0.24 → 0.021 • Escalate to Argon/HITL whenever p̂ &amp;lt; 0.85&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#A7F3D0;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="462" y="140" width="434" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="cl_tl" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;VERBALIZED CONFIDENCE LIE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;RLHF Sycophancy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Asking an LLM &amp;ldquo;Rate Your Confidence 0–100%&amp;rdquo; in Text&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Post-trained models output &amp;ldquo;95% confident&amp;rdquo; on almost every hallucination (&lt;b&gt;ECE = 0.24&lt;/b&gt;), breaking router cascades.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;31pt Overconfidence Gap&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cl_tr" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#059669;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;CALIBRATED CONFORMAL GATE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#D1FAE5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;ECE ≤ 0.025 Target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Fit Isotonic / Temperature Scaling on Held-Out Logprobs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;When calibrated &lt;b&gt;p̂ = 0.90&lt;/b&gt; truly means &lt;b&gt;90% accuracy&lt;/b&gt;, your Flash→Argon cascade &amp;amp; HITL escalation become mathematically optimal.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;11× Lower Calibration Error&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cl_bot" value="&lt;div style='width:832px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;background:#F8FAFC;border:1.4px solid #CBD5E1;border-radius:16px;padding:9px 13px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;MNEMONIC: C · A · L · I · B · R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#ECFDF5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Uncertainty Quantification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Collect Held-Out Logprobs • Aggregate Semantic Entropy • Learn Isotonic Scaler • Inspect 10 Decile Bins • Bound ECE ≤ 0.025 • Route Low-p̂ to HITL&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;In medical, legal, and finance AI, &lt;b&gt;calibrated selective abstention&lt;/b&gt; matters more than raw uncalibrated top-1 accuracy.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="788" width="836" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

